WEBVTT

00:06:59.356 --> 00:07:01.116
I'm choosing to do the latter.

00:07:01.116 --> 00:07:03.916
I'd like you to close
your eyes for a second.

00:07:03.956 --> 00:07:05.956
I want you to imagine a world

00:07:05.996 --> 00:07:09.076
where our measure of success
is not productivity.

00:07:09.836 --> 00:07:11.596
I want you to imagine a world

00:07:11.636 --> 00:07:15.156
where instead of thinking
about busyness and titles

00:07:15.196 --> 00:07:16.596
and bank balances,

00:07:16.596 --> 00:07:18.596
we think about our impact on the world.

00:07:18.916 --> 00:07:20.316
I want you to imagine a world

00:07:20.356 --> 00:07:23.356
where status isn't the reason
for our existence.

00:07:24.276 --> 00:07:25.636
Open your eyes.

00:07:26.436 --> 00:07:30.316
I'd now like to introduce you
to the Personal Moral Inventory.